  m_Name: ModConfig
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: MythicalPlates
  title: Mythical Plates
  author: thunder725
  description: "\"The rightful bearer of a Plate draws from the Plate it holds.\"\r\n\r\nHarness
    the power of the Mythical Plates and defy the very fabric of reality!\r\n\r\n18
    new challenges all centered around a mechanic of Void, combined with a cellular
    automaton, a tower defense game, a Rubik's Cube or a chain of plane flights.\r\n\r\nIf
    you feel adventurous, you can defy the Allmighty Sinnoh and solve 3 randomly-selected
    Plates in a row.\r\nOtherwise, they each are contained within their own individual
    Plate module.\r\n\r\nCreated by: thunder725\r\n\r\nIncludes the following 19 modules:\r\n-
    Allmighty Sinnoh\r\n- Blank Plate\r\n- Draco Plate\r\n- Dread Plate\r\n- Earth
    Plate\r\n- Fist Plate\r\n- Flame Plate\r\n- Icicle Plate\r\n- Insect Plate\r\n-
    Iron Plate\r\n- Meadow Plate\r\n- Mind Plate\r\n- Pixie Plate\r\n- Sky Plate\r\n-
    Splash Plate\r\n- Spooky Plate\r\n- Stone Plate\r\n- Toxic Plate\r\n- Zap Plate\r\n\r\nManuals
    can be found at https://ktane.timwi.de/\r\n\r\nIncludes full Twitch Plays compatibility.\r\nIncludes
    Ruleseed compatibility except for Pixie Plate and Toxic Plate.\r\n\r\n=-= Version
    History =-=\r\n=-= 0.8\r\n- Open for Public Beta Testing\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.1\r\n-
    Fixed Draco Plate and Blank Plate modules not having proper reset buttons.\r\n\r\n=-=
    0.8.2\r\n- Pixie Plate: Fixed Ifle-Sym healing Demons when attacking them if its
    attack stat was negative.\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.3\r\n- Pixie Plate: Void now affects
    player movement during the setup phase\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.4\r\n- Allmighty Sinnoh:
    Fixed a bug where Step Two would not apply if only the Mark of Antimatter was
    affected.\r\n- Fist Plate: Made D5 and D7 unable to get Voided.\r\n- Blank Plate:
    Adjusted Path generation to be a shorter part of the module. Compressed Log for
    clearer explanations.\r\n- Sky Plate: Favorized path being affected by Voided
    Cities\r\nThanks Blan!\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.5\r\n- Sky Plate: Fixed several bugs in
    the puzzle generation, and rewrote Logging to be much clearer for players.\r\n-
    Iron Plate, Meadow Plate: Cleaned Logging by only including the final puzzle generation
    and not the aborted ones.\r\n- Dread Plate, Flame Plate, Splash Plate, Toxic Plate:
    Slightly tweaked logging\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.6\r\n- Allmighty Sinnoh: Made the Mark
    of Time wiggle more noticeable. Added TP command to get Mark of Time read if needed.
    Fixed TP command Plate sub-handler being treated as invalid by TP due to empty
    return.\r\n- Zap Plate: Fixed TP handler not working.\r\n- Dread Plate: Added
    \"press\" as a valid keyword for TP command submission.\r\n\r\n=-= 0.8.7\r\n-
    Zap Plate: Changed Table Looping behaviour to make the module slightly more interesting\r\n-
    Mind Plate: Made movement logging slightly more readable\r\n- Icicle Plate: Fixed
    incorrect logging of the last movement on a successful attempt\r\n\r\n=-= 0.9.0\r\n-
    Added Ruleseed Support to Blank Plate, Sky Plate, Earth Plate, Stone Plate, Insect
    Plate, Spooky Plate, Flame Plate, Splash Plate, Meadow Plate, Zap Plate, Mind
    Plate, Icicle Plate, Draco Plate and Dread Plate.\r\n- Dread Plate: Changed letter-symbol
    pairing\r\n- Removed timer question for Insect Plate due to Allmighty Sinnoh summoning\r\n\r\n=-=
    1.0.0\r\n- Ruleseed Support added to Fist Plate and Iron Plate.\n- Added solving
    animation to Allmighty Sinnoh\r.\n- Fixed Blank Plate's solution generation being
    incomplete.\n- Added more puzzles to Pixie Plate.\n\n=-= 1.0.1\n- Tweaked some
    Logs to be clearer and help with future LFA support.\n\n=-= 1.0.2\n- Made Blank
    Plate log the pressed button if you Strike.\n\n=-= 1.0.3\n- Tweaked Insect Plate's
    colour to be closer to green than yellow.\n\n=-= 1.0.4\n- Fixed off-by-one error
    in Blank Plate puzzle generation\r\n- Fixed a punctuation mark in Dread Plate
    messing with \"What\" being voided\r\n- Added a more explicit Fist Plate logging
    for opposite Redirection direction\r\n- Fixed a potential issue with Digital Root
    algorithm\n\n=-= 1.0.5\n- Gave a unique sound to Spooky Plate instead of recycling
    Pixie's.\n- Made Pixie Plate's sound louder.\n"
  version: 1.0.0
  outputFolder: build
  debugBuild: 0
  previewImage: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3435afec60dddb141ad5f45675da578c, type: 3}
